The smell that lured you, became stronger. There were obviously some rustling in the shrubs. You stopped like waiting for something. Another wolf slowly went out of the shrubbery on the forest road, right in front of you. A she-wolf to be precise. 
"Who are you?" you automatically asked.
"I'm a werewolf, just like you," she answered. "After transformation I hid myself here. So we live here all together now."
"Are there many of you?!" you was surprised.
"No, just five. You can stay with us," she proposed.
It sounded quite tempting, but you wanted to know what you was enchanted for, and avenge yourself.
"I need to finish one business," you said. "But, maybe I'll be back."
After those words you ran off. Soon  you faced one more road fork.